cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NyxOS in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "NyxOS"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch x86_64 operating system written in C and Assembly, featuring a
  GUI desktop, a real network stack (TCP/IP with TLS 1.2), image decoders, and a
  self-hosting in-OS C toolchain.
type: software
authors:
